# Release Notes

## EN
We have introduced several exciting updates to make your app experience smoother and more efficient. This version focuses on adding useful new features and improving overall reliability for a better daily experience.

- Biometric login support for a faster and more secure way to access your account
- New in-app notification center to keep track of all your important alerts in one place
- Dark mode toggle in settings to customize your app appearance for better comfort
- Scheduled payments feature to help you manage and automate your transactions easily
- Improved app startup time by 40% for a much quicker and more responsive feel

## ID
